{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51982","headline":"诗 · 宁化九龙进士","name":"诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"远远青青叠叠峯，峯前真宰读书翁。\n半岩冷落高宗雨，一洞凄凉吉甫风。\n溪隐豹眠寒雾露，井凋凤宿点梧桐。\n九龙山下英雄气，尽属君王宇宙中。\n（《永乐大典》七八九二「汀」字韵引《临汀志·祠庙》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宁化九龙进士","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51982.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51982","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}